/-!
# A Boolean equality test of the specification's syntax and code, and its soundness

Generated by scripts/dev/pins_gen.lean; do not edit. To regenerate:

    nix develop ~/.local/state/ecma-formal/devshell -c \
      lake env lean --run scripts/dev/pins_gen.lean lean/Engine/Proofs/Pins/Gen

`T.eqB a b = true → a = b` (`T.eqB_sound`) for each type `Ecma.Machine.Ins`, `Ecma.Alg`, `Ecma.SdoRow` and
`Ecma.Machine.RowCode` reach: by derived `DecidableEq` where the type has no recursion, else by structural
recursion, a helper for each nested shape.
